Port of macos/Sources/MalachiMail/Calendar/CalendarAgendaViewController.swift
(the table, AgendaGroupCell, AgendaItemCell); GTK: the calendar's views
follow (docs/calendar.md §6.4). The Agenda view, the Unanswered filter
and the search results (docs/calendar.md §5.4): a heading above the list
in place of the view ("Results", "Invitations"), a list with a heading
line per day (none for the results) and lines of time (or All Day),
colour dot, title, place and badge, and the controller's empty text.
Every text is the line's (AgendaEntry), plain.
